WEBVTT

01:37.770 --> 01:42.990
[Spring of The Blade]

01:43.310 --> 01:45.880
[Episode 21]

01:46.710 --> 01:48.570
I, Li Congxin, swear here and now:

01:48.920 --> 01:49.920
in this life,

01:50.640 --> 01:52.229
I will marry only you as my wife

01:52.229 --> 01:53.759
and never take a concubine.

01:54.000 --> 01:55.789
I will never let you relive the tragedy

01:55.789 --> 01:59.320
your mother endured
amid the intrigues of the inner household.

02:06.680 --> 02:07.680
It's just that...

02:08.240 --> 02:11.300
the daughter-in-law
your mother has always wanted...

02:11.870 --> 02:12.870
isn't me,

02:14.360 --> 02:15.470
but Second Sister.

02:15.590 --> 02:16.590
Of course not.

02:20.960 --> 02:21.820
Fourth Sister,

02:22.079 --> 02:22.870
don't worry.

02:23.150 --> 02:23.810
I'll go back

02:24.150 --> 02:25.710
and have a proper talk with my mother.

02:25.710 --> 02:26.520
In this life,

02:26.750 --> 02:29.010
I will marry no one but you, Xie Qingyuan.

02:31.150 --> 02:32.079
So...

02:37.310 --> 02:38.520
will you marry me?

03:10.150 --> 03:11.870
Can't you just sit still

03:11.870 --> 03:13.240
for a moment?

03:13.240 --> 03:15.000
Whatever it is, let's sit down and talk.

03:15.000 --> 03:16.190
I'm troubled!

03:16.520 --> 03:18.430
Madam Hu has been telling me all along

03:18.430 --> 03:20.030
that our son's match
would be with their second daughter.

03:20.030 --> 03:21.030
But today, Chunzhi

03:21.030 --> 03:22.590
made it clear to
their fourth daughter, Xie Qingyuan,

03:22.590 --> 03:24.450
that he would marry no one but her.

03:24.520 --> 03:25.710
What should we do?

03:26.520 --> 03:28.680
Our son has always been free-spirited.

03:28.680 --> 03:31.750
It's rare for him to care this much
about who he marries.

03:31.910 --> 03:33.400
Just let him have his way.

03:33.910 --> 03:34.840
Marquis,

03:34.960 --> 03:36.890
that's not what you said last time!

03:39.000 --> 03:40.240
I hit you too hard?

03:40.710 --> 03:41.770
I'm fine, I'm fine.

03:42.120 --> 03:44.360
It's not that I insist on
a highborn lady for our son.

03:44.360 --> 03:45.870
Our son is simple-hearted.

03:45.870 --> 03:47.930
Xie Qingyuan doesn't truly love him.

03:48.280 --> 03:49.810
If they really get married,

03:49.870 --> 03:51.710
there'll be no end of friction
down the road.

03:51.710 --> 03:53.570
Doesn't it hurt to think about it?

03:54.710 --> 03:57.440
Though she isn't
the principal wife's daughter,

03:57.520 --> 03:59.190
she conducts herself with prudence

03:59.190 --> 04:00.960
and propriety.

04:01.360 --> 04:03.310
If this marriage goes through,

04:03.310 --> 04:06.190
she will never do our son wrong.

04:08.590 --> 04:10.520
Changing your tune just like that.

04:17.829 --> 04:18.829
Fine, fine.

04:19.360 --> 04:21.000
Since Chunzhi has made up his mind,

04:21.000 --> 04:23.400
I can't tear these lovebirds apart, right?

04:26.190 --> 04:27.510
I agree to this marriage

04:27.510 --> 04:29.370
because it is with the Xie family,

04:29.430 --> 04:30.800
not because it is with Fourth Lady Xie.

04:30.800 --> 04:31.720
Exactly.

04:33.159 --> 04:33.920
Alright.

04:34.360 --> 04:36.620
Then let's prepare the betrothal gifts.

04:36.750 --> 04:38.120
Our son is getting married.

04:38.120 --> 04:40.000
The gifts mustn't be skimped on,

04:40.070 --> 04:41.680
lest we become a laughingstock.

04:41.680 --> 04:43.270
Don't you think so?

04:49.190 --> 04:52.190
Sooner or later, you and our son
will be the death of me.

04:54.680 --> 04:57.390
My son is getting married.

05:02.720 --> 05:04.680
Come on, come and see.

05:05.870 --> 05:07.520
Why are there so many things?

05:07.600 --> 05:09.310
Gosh, there are 2 whole rows.

05:11.190 --> 05:12.040
I like that one.

05:12.040 --> 05:13.430
I like that hairpin.

05:13.370 --> 05:15.470
[Moonlight Casts Its Radiance]

05:14.920 --> 05:16.870
I still remember that day
at the Spring Banquet,

05:16.870 --> 05:19.310
when Chunzhi
rode his horse and shot arrows.

05:19.310 --> 05:20.750
He was truly impressive.

05:20.940 --> 05:26.210
[Moonlight Casts Its Radiance]

05:21.240 --> 05:22.510
From that day on,

05:22.510 --> 05:23.950
I made up my mind

05:24.480 --> 05:26.340
that I'd marry him no matter what.

05:26.430 --> 05:28.890
Second Sister,
you'll surely get your wish.

05:29.630 --> 05:30.680
Of course.

05:33.190 --> 05:34.680
What do you suppose Chunzhi

05:34.680 --> 05:36.750
has been doing these past few days?

05:37.070 --> 05:39.120
I'd guess Chunzhi...

05:40.390 --> 05:41.990
has been thinking about you.

05:43.070 --> 05:44.120
My Lady!

05:44.870 --> 05:45.870
My Lady!

05:48.720 --> 05:52.780
The Marquis of Danyang household
has come to formally propose marriage!

05:59.560 --> 06:00.430
Move aside now!

06:01.750 --> 06:03.830
Look at all these gifts. Who do you think

06:03.830 --> 06:05.000
they are for?

06:05.070 --> 06:07.270
Which young lady could be so fortunate?

06:08.360 --> 06:09.940
Isn't it obvious?

06:10.040 --> 06:11.830
Of course, it's for our Second Lady,

06:11.830 --> 06:13.720
from the Heir of the Marquis of Danyang.

06:13.720 --> 06:14.510
Exactly.

06:14.680 --> 06:15.920
For Second Lady.

06:15.920 --> 06:17.720
Second Lady is so lucky.

06:17.720 --> 06:19.160
Old Madam has arrived!

06:30.310 --> 06:31.750
The Marquis of Danyang household

06:31.750 --> 06:34.680
respectfully addresses
the honorable Xie family.

06:34.800 --> 06:37.920
[Formal Marriage Contract]

06:35.070 --> 06:37.480
With reverence,
heaven unfurls its brocade clouds,

06:37.480 --> 06:39.040
and earth brings forth its finest jade,

06:39.040 --> 06:41.000
and so a house of noble lineage
now comes forward.

06:41.000 --> 06:44.000
Li Congxin, Heir to the
Marquisate of Danyang, comes from a family

06:44.000 --> 06:45.870
that has upheld honor
and distinguished service for generations.

06:45.870 --> 06:47.830
He is a man of noble character,
skilled in the martial arts,

06:47.830 --> 06:49.680
steeped in poetry and propriety,

06:49.680 --> 06:51.240
and observant of the Six Rites.

06:51.240 --> 06:52.720
We therefore humbly seek
the good offices of a matchmaker,

06:52.720 --> 06:53.320
in the hope

06:53.510 --> 06:55.440
that you will consent to this union

06:55.630 --> 06:57.870
and let our two families be joined as one.

06:57.870 --> 07:00.750
Congratulations, Fourth Lady Xie Qingyuan.

07:06.680 --> 07:07.560
Old Madam,

07:08.190 --> 07:09.070
Lord Xie,

07:09.240 --> 07:11.750
the Heir put a great deal of thought

07:12.040 --> 07:13.920
into the betrothal gifts
for Fourth Lady Xie.

07:13.920 --> 07:15.240
And this pair of wild geese

07:15.240 --> 07:16.630
was hunted by the Heir

07:16.680 --> 07:17.750
himself.

07:25.830 --> 07:29.600
Please accept the betrothal gifts,
Fourth Lady Xie.

07:29.800 --> 07:34.040
Please accept the betrothal gifts,
Fourth Lady Xie.

07:35.720 --> 07:37.180
Once you and I are married,

07:37.560 --> 07:39.600
you'll be the Young Madam of
the Marquis of Danyang household.

07:39.600 --> 07:40.930
And since that murderer

07:41.360 --> 07:43.360
killed the relative of an official,

07:43.510 --> 07:45.110
he should be beheaded for it.

07:47.480 --> 07:49.120
It was agreed that he would marry me.

07:49.120 --> 07:51.510
How did it suddenly become Xie Qingyuan
without so much as a word?

07:51.510 --> 07:53.390
When on earth will Mother be let out?

07:53.390 --> 07:54.240
Second Sister,

07:54.240 --> 07:55.480
Mother is still confined to quarters.

07:55.480 --> 07:56.310
If you go now,

07:56.310 --> 07:59.570
you'll only make Grandmother
and Father more displeased.

08:01.040 --> 08:01.560
Out of my way.

08:01.560 --> 08:02.820
I want to see my mother.

08:03.240 --> 08:04.000
Second Lady,

08:04.720 --> 08:05.800
Master has ordered that

08:05.800 --> 08:06.950
during Madam's recuperation,

08:06.950 --> 08:08.210
no visits are allowed.

08:11.120 --> 08:12.050
Get out of my way!

08:12.430 --> 08:14.040
I'm only carrying out Master's orders.

08:14.040 --> 08:15.430
Second Lady, you're making such a fuss.

08:15.430 --> 08:17.360
Are you trying to embarrass Madam?

08:23.390 --> 08:25.870
Second Lady, you behave
with such disregard for propriety—

08:25.870 --> 08:27.670
did Madam Hu raise you like this?

08:27.720 --> 08:28.270
You...

08:28.270 --> 08:29.200
What did you say?

08:32.240 --> 08:32.789
My Lady!

08:33.630 --> 08:35.030
She's the principal wife's daughter.

08:35.030 --> 08:37.490
Do you know the consequences
if you hurt her?

08:37.630 --> 08:39.390
My mother and father have always
been devoted to each other.

08:39.390 --> 08:41.120
She's merely been confined to her quarters
for a few days.

08:41.120 --> 08:43.840
And you, a lowly servant,
dare to walk all over me?

08:43.840 --> 08:45.720
How dare I hurt you, My Lady?

08:45.870 --> 08:46.910
But if you

08:46.910 --> 08:48.570
insist on acting recklessly,

08:48.630 --> 08:51.120
I have no choice but to
invoke the family rules.

08:51.120 --> 08:52.200
Family rules?

08:53.870 --> 08:55.750
She even dares to mention family rules!

08:55.750 --> 08:56.360
Fine!

08:56.790 --> 08:58.310
I'll go fetch Grandmother right now

08:58.310 --> 08:59.310
and let her decide

08:59.600 --> 09:01.600
who should be punished
under the family rules.

09:01.600 --> 09:02.390
Get lost!

09:08.720 --> 09:09.520
Grandmother,

09:09.600 --> 09:11.550
I just wanted to see my mother,

09:11.870 --> 09:13.360
but this wretched maid, Yuejian,

09:13.360 --> 09:15.080
actually threatened me with the family rules
and even cursed at me!

09:15.080 --> 09:17.810
She truly has no regard
for her mistress anymore!

09:18.910 --> 09:19.670
Grandmother,

09:19.670 --> 09:21.530
you have to make this right for me.

09:26.670 --> 09:27.390
Yuejian.

09:29.720 --> 09:30.720
Come here and sit.

09:37.720 --> 09:38.520
Grandmother.

09:40.840 --> 09:41.510
Sit.

09:54.240 --> 09:55.510
Yuejian is now

09:56.200 --> 09:58.000
your Sixth Madam.

09:58.270 --> 09:59.790
She is your elder now.

10:00.240 --> 10:01.040
Not to mention

10:01.320 --> 10:03.580
she's acting on the patriarch's orders—

10:03.840 --> 10:05.240
even if she herself

10:05.480 --> 10:07.110
wanted to discipline you,

10:07.390 --> 10:09.650
she would still have every right to do so.

10:10.720 --> 10:12.080
Sixth Madam?

10:14.550 --> 10:17.680
You actually took advantage of
my mother's confinement

10:17.840 --> 10:19.220
to seduce my father!

10:19.270 --> 10:20.200
Insolent!

10:22.080 --> 10:22.880
Grandmother,

10:23.670 --> 10:25.840
Second Sister only spoke
without thinking because she

10:25.840 --> 10:27.370
was in a moment of distress.

10:27.440 --> 10:29.440
Mothers and daughters share a deep bond.

10:29.440 --> 10:30.630
Grandmother, I believe you

10:30.630 --> 10:32.550
wouldn't want such a trivial matter

10:32.550 --> 10:34.680
to disturb the peace of the household.

10:34.720 --> 10:35.360
Why not

10:35.600 --> 10:37.130
fulfill my sisters' wishes

10:37.200 --> 10:38.720
and let them visit Mother?

10:39.360 --> 10:40.840
That way, there won't be

10:41.000 --> 10:43.730
constant commotion
in front of Wuzhu Courtyard.

10:46.200 --> 10:47.000
Fine.

10:47.360 --> 10:49.090
Let your mother see for herself

10:49.600 --> 10:50.630
what

10:51.480 --> 10:53.720
you have done these past days.

10:58.270 --> 11:00.510
Spare me your false kindness.

11:00.960 --> 11:03.030
The Marquis of Danyang household
came to offer you betrothal gifts—

11:03.030 --> 11:04.830
what tricks did you play in this?

11:06.600 --> 11:08.360
Don't celebrate just yet.

11:08.870 --> 11:10.390
Whatever is mine,

11:11.270 --> 11:12.600
you can never take away.

11:17.630 --> 11:18.430
Grandmother.

11:27.240 --> 11:28.390
Look at her.

11:29.320 --> 11:31.750
See how her mother has spoiled her.

11:35.910 --> 11:37.480
Listen up, all of you.

11:37.720 --> 11:39.720
Although this is a large household,

11:40.000 --> 11:40.870
it has no room

11:41.480 --> 11:44.840
for servants who outwardly comply
while secretly defying orders.

11:44.840 --> 11:46.240
If anyone

11:46.550 --> 11:48.510
relies on their seniority

11:48.910 --> 11:50.480
to throw their weight around

11:50.480 --> 11:52.600
and make things difficult for Sixth Madam,

11:52.600 --> 11:53.870
don't blame me

11:54.600 --> 11:55.870
for showing no mercy.

11:56.600 --> 11:58.030
Yes, Old Madam.

12:00.270 --> 12:01.150
Yuejian.

12:01.960 --> 12:03.360
Take them away.

12:19.080 --> 12:20.120
Qingyuan.

12:21.750 --> 12:22.810
Come sit beside me.

12:29.670 --> 12:31.240
Have you heard people say

12:32.360 --> 12:34.910
that a woman may never leave
the inner household,

12:34.910 --> 12:39.030
yet she can still hold the fate
of the entire family in her hands?

12:39.720 --> 12:40.790
On a small scale,

12:41.720 --> 12:44.440
it means managing the household well

12:44.910 --> 12:47.110
and handling relationships properly.

12:47.150 --> 12:48.320
On a grand scale,

12:49.270 --> 12:51.030
we too

12:51.270 --> 12:52.550
have a part to play in

12:53.120 --> 12:54.440
who rises to power

12:55.480 --> 12:58.080
and who falls from favor
at the imperial court.

13:03.670 --> 13:04.670
Now that you

13:05.270 --> 13:06.240
have secured

13:06.240 --> 13:08.200
such a fine marriage match,

13:08.670 --> 13:10.910
this isn't only your own good fortune

13:12.080 --> 13:14.480
but also our family's.

13:16.670 --> 13:17.790
You do

13:18.200 --> 13:19.480
have quite a knack

13:20.150 --> 13:21.910
for managing money

13:22.390 --> 13:23.270
and quite a way

13:23.630 --> 13:25.120
with people too.

13:25.790 --> 13:26.720
However,

13:27.840 --> 13:29.200
official rank,

13:29.630 --> 13:30.480
status,

13:31.000 --> 13:32.240
and family wealth—

13:33.320 --> 13:34.910
none of these last forever.

13:35.240 --> 13:36.700
One day, without warning,

13:37.200 --> 13:38.550
they can all

13:39.320 --> 13:40.550
be taken from you.

13:44.440 --> 13:46.000
Only blood ties

13:47.480 --> 13:49.720
endure.

13:50.360 --> 13:52.670
After you marry into
the Marquis of Danyang household,

13:52.670 --> 13:53.670
don't forget

13:54.150 --> 13:56.440
that you're still a member
of the Xie family.

13:56.440 --> 13:58.630
You must speak well of us

13:59.200 --> 14:01.440
and protect our interests.

14:02.510 --> 14:03.390
As for

14:04.080 --> 14:06.670
the grievances of the past...

14:09.790 --> 14:10.480
you

14:11.320 --> 14:12.790
should let them go.

14:16.480 --> 14:17.960
I often think of

14:18.550 --> 14:20.880
the kindness you and Father have shown me.

14:21.320 --> 14:22.870
No matter where I am,

14:23.480 --> 14:26.480
I'll certainly put
the Xie family's interests first.

14:34.600 --> 14:35.440
My Lady,

14:35.550 --> 14:37.120
you've been gazing into space
for so long now.

14:37.120 --> 14:38.720
What are you thinking about?

14:41.000 --> 14:44.030
I know full well that I've only
risen in Grandmother's estimation

14:44.030 --> 14:46.490
because of my engagement
to Young Master Li.

14:47.390 --> 14:48.440
In all my life,

14:49.030 --> 14:50.430
other than my own mother,

14:50.840 --> 14:52.270
I've never once been

14:52.550 --> 14:55.270
this close to a blood relative before.

14:56.440 --> 14:57.360
I was wondering

14:58.550 --> 15:01.030
what it's like for those girls
who are loved by their parents

15:01.030 --> 15:01.840
in the days

15:02.440 --> 15:04.030
before they marry out.

15:32.360 --> 15:33.120
My Lord,

15:33.840 --> 15:36.720
Fourth Lady Xie really is engaged
to the Heir of the Marquis of Danyang.

15:36.720 --> 15:38.320
I just heard that the betrothal gifts
have been delivered.

15:38.320 --> 15:41.390
The wild geese and marriage contract
have been sent to the Xie Residence.

15:41.390 --> 15:43.390
I hear the Heir's feelings run deep.

15:43.670 --> 15:45.070
He even personally urged

15:45.080 --> 15:49.680
the Marchioness of Danyang to have
the marriage contract prepared without delay.

15:52.790 --> 15:54.050
Whether you're Yan Rui

15:55.030 --> 15:56.030
or Shen Run,

15:57.000 --> 15:58.730
since our paths are different,

16:00.670 --> 16:01.870
let's part ways here.

16:40.670 --> 16:41.440
Sir.

16:42.440 --> 16:43.270
Do you sell

16:43.360 --> 16:44.790
yellow paper here?

16:45.750 --> 16:46.790
Third Lady Xie?

16:51.240 --> 16:53.270
How do you know me, sir?

16:53.750 --> 16:54.670
I am Zhou Peian,

16:55.000 --> 16:56.910
a fellow disciple and senior classmate
of Pei Lanshan.

16:56.910 --> 16:58.150
I once caught a glimpse of you

16:58.150 --> 17:00.280
at the Spring Banquet, Third Lady Xie.

17:01.630 --> 17:02.960
So, you're Senior Zhou.

17:06.069 --> 17:07.589
We don't have

17:07.640 --> 17:09.310
the yellow paper you're looking for here.

17:09.310 --> 17:10.550
However, it's not hard to find.

17:10.550 --> 17:11.609
I'll keep an eye out

17:11.829 --> 17:14.270
and have it delivered
to your residence later.

17:14.270 --> 17:15.930
Then, thank you, Senior Zhou.

17:18.160 --> 17:18.750
Goodbye.

17:19.480 --> 17:20.339
Third Lady Xie.

17:22.349 --> 17:24.410
What's this scripture in your hands?

17:27.310 --> 17:28.770
This is the Rebirth Sutra,

17:29.070 --> 17:30.950
used to pray for my late mother.

17:38.270 --> 17:39.730
This isn't my place to say,

17:40.000 --> 17:40.880
but

17:41.000 --> 17:43.070
there is no room for error
in matters concerning the dead.

17:43.070 --> 17:44.920
The scripture in your hands is actually

17:44.920 --> 17:47.510
the Soul-Suppressing Mantra,
used to suppress vengeful spirits.

17:47.510 --> 17:50.160
It's an exceedingly rare scripture.

18:00.680 --> 18:01.550
Fourth Sister!

18:02.680 --> 18:03.540
Fourth Sister!

18:06.960 --> 18:07.820
Fourth Sister!

18:21.200 --> 18:22.530
Last time, you warned me

18:23.400 --> 18:24.860
that my own mother's death

18:24.960 --> 18:26.960
was not solely Mei Yinghua's doing.

18:27.000 --> 18:28.260
Do you know something?

18:38.310 --> 18:39.070
To be honest,

18:39.590 --> 18:40.920
I don't want anyone else

18:41.440 --> 18:42.830
dragged into this.

18:44.240 --> 18:45.460
But if there truly is

18:45.830 --> 18:47.000
more to it,

18:47.240 --> 18:48.720
then whoever was responsible

18:48.720 --> 18:51.000
has been hiding
in the household for 19 years.

18:51.000 --> 18:52.480
That's frightening enough that we can't

18:52.480 --> 18:54.080
afford to let our guard down.

18:58.880 --> 19:01.280
Mei Yinghua knows nothing about medicine.

19:01.350 --> 19:04.590
In this entire household, the person
most knowledgeable about medicine

19:04.590 --> 19:05.680
is Concubine Lian.

19:06.350 --> 19:07.720
And on the day my own mother died,

19:07.720 --> 19:09.920
she was the only one nowhere to be found.

19:10.680 --> 19:13.030
Could she be involved in this?

19:15.310 --> 19:17.830
Concubine Lian did tell Concubine Mei

19:17.830 --> 19:19.480
about the toxicity of the euphorbia.

19:19.480 --> 19:22.880
But she's kept to herself,
rarely going out for over a decade,

19:23.000 --> 19:25.830
and she can't even decide
her own daughter's marriage.

19:25.830 --> 19:27.490
With a temperament like hers,

19:27.510 --> 19:28.720
how could she possibly

19:28.720 --> 19:30.450
have done such a vicious thing?

19:38.830 --> 19:40.790
Those who witnessed it firsthand back then

19:40.790 --> 19:41.750
are either dead

19:42.550 --> 19:43.480
or long gone.

19:44.550 --> 19:45.750
Of those who remain,

19:46.220 --> 19:48.020
Concubine Lian dares not speak,

19:48.590 --> 19:50.880
and Grandmother would rather
let the matter rest

19:50.880 --> 19:52.000
than tell you.

19:52.350 --> 19:54.010
Of everyone, Mother is the one

19:56.750 --> 19:57.880
who should tell you.

20:00.310 --> 20:02.110
Even if she doesn't know the full truth,

20:02.110 --> 20:04.970
she shouldn't be
stopping you from looking into it.

20:05.550 --> 20:06.510
You're

20:08.070 --> 20:08.930
suspecting...

20:13.070 --> 20:13.920
Third Sister,

20:16.030 --> 20:17.240
can you still recall

20:17.240 --> 20:18.770
the details from back then?

20:19.030 --> 20:19.680
Who

20:20.000 --> 20:21.460
went to Luoying Pavilion?

20:21.830 --> 20:22.550
Who

20:23.110 --> 20:25.240
was the first to find your mother dead?

20:35.400 --> 20:36.110
I remember.

20:38.920 --> 20:40.580
Back then, apart from Cui'er,

20:41.440 --> 20:43.480
only Grandmother and Mother came.

20:44.680 --> 20:46.790
Then they covered her with a white cloth

20:46.790 --> 20:47.990
and carried her away.

20:50.350 --> 20:53.480
Do you still remember
what your mother looked like then?

20:54.070 --> 20:54.880
At that time,

20:55.550 --> 20:57.210
I saw that her face was bluish,

20:57.480 --> 20:58.880
and her lips were purple.

20:58.960 --> 20:59.890
What did you say?

21:01.920 --> 21:04.250
Your mother didn't die from a hemorrhage?

21:04.400 --> 21:05.240
A hemorrhage?

21:08.830 --> 21:09.590
No.

21:10.000 --> 21:10.550
I...

21:11.350 --> 21:12.640
Even though I was still young then,

21:12.640 --> 21:13.780
I remember clearly.

21:14.960 --> 21:16.560
There was no heavy bleeding.

21:20.160 --> 21:21.820
Poisoning from the euphorbia

21:22.160 --> 21:24.110
causes miscarriage
with severe hemorrhaging.

21:24.110 --> 21:25.980
If the face is deathly pale

21:26.310 --> 21:27.480
and bluish,

21:28.160 --> 21:29.340
with purple lips,

21:30.270 --> 21:31.240
it indicates...

21:38.790 --> 21:40.000
suffocation.

21:46.250 --> 21:48.810
[Danyue Pavilion]

21:54.720 --> 21:55.640
My Lady!

21:55.750 --> 21:58.440
Old Madam has gone to Hanxiang Parlor
with Yuejian.

21:58.440 --> 21:59.250
They said

21:59.440 --> 22:02.500
they'll marry Eldest Lady off
to the Hu family tonight.

22:06.960 --> 22:08.150
Enough,

22:09.000 --> 22:09.870
Fanqiao.

22:10.640 --> 22:12.720
Stop crying.

22:13.830 --> 22:16.550
Commissioner Hu is a man of great status.

22:16.790 --> 22:18.850
It wouldn't be an exaggeration to say

22:18.880 --> 22:20.680
he's at the pinnacle of officialdom.

22:20.680 --> 22:23.210
The fact that he's taken a liking
to our Qinghe

22:23.590 --> 22:25.960
is her good fortune.

22:28.160 --> 22:29.220
Old Madam,

22:29.510 --> 22:30.400
you suddenly announced

22:30.400 --> 22:31.960
that she'll be married off today.

22:31.960 --> 22:33.890
We haven't prepared anything yet.

22:34.110 --> 22:35.790
Isn't this rather rushed?

22:36.240 --> 22:38.970
I beg you to discuss it further
with the patriarch

22:39.000 --> 22:40.350
and delay it a few days.

22:46.680 --> 22:47.920
This marriage

22:48.440 --> 22:50.160
was decided long ago.

22:50.790 --> 22:53.070
The betrothal gifts
have also been delivered.

22:53.070 --> 22:53.790
Look,

22:54.350 --> 22:57.720
the wedding robe you sewed yourself
for our Qinghe

22:58.000 --> 22:59.130
fits her perfectly,

22:59.400 --> 23:01.510
and now it's finally being put to use.

23:03.160 --> 23:04.270
Qinghe

23:04.750 --> 23:05.880
is going to marry him

23:06.920 --> 23:08.640
as a concubine,

23:09.030 --> 23:11.640
not as a properly wedded principal wife.

23:12.110 --> 23:14.240
There's no need for much preparation.

23:15.440 --> 23:16.270
Right now,

23:16.880 --> 23:19.480
the Hu family's bridal sedan chair
is waiting.

23:19.960 --> 23:22.760
How can you expect me
to go back on the marriage now?

23:23.160 --> 23:24.270
Not only would that

23:24.640 --> 23:26.040
humiliate the Hu family,

23:26.240 --> 23:28.100
but it would also leave our family

23:28.830 --> 23:30.560
with no way to hold our heads up.

23:32.680 --> 23:33.550
Grandmother,

23:34.350 --> 23:36.350
the Pei family
has already come to clarify that

23:36.350 --> 23:40.480
the engagement was broken off because
Madam Pei's mourning period is not yet over.

23:40.480 --> 23:42.740
Young Master Pei and I are deeply in love.

23:43.960 --> 23:45.000
I hope you

23:45.640 --> 23:47.270
can give me a few more days.

23:47.960 --> 23:49.000
Old Madam!

23:53.920 --> 23:55.030
The Pei family

23:56.310 --> 23:58.110
has already shown your father

23:58.530 --> 24:00.110
more than enough courtesy

24:00.960 --> 24:02.960
by not spelling things out plainly.

24:03.070 --> 24:04.640
You should know better

24:04.880 --> 24:06.510
and give up on this.

24:06.960 --> 24:08.960
You're 5 years older than Qingyuan.

24:09.510 --> 24:10.200
Now,

24:10.480 --> 24:13.340
she is about to marry into
the Marquis's household.

24:13.440 --> 24:16.570
Yet, your engagement with the Pei family
was broken off.

24:17.240 --> 24:19.270
If we don't do something,

24:19.790 --> 24:20.750
others

24:21.510 --> 24:23.920
will laugh at our family.

24:26.480 --> 24:27.440
Enough.

24:28.400 --> 24:30.270
This is the decision the patriarch and I

24:30.270 --> 24:31.480
have made together.

24:33.240 --> 24:35.040
There's no room for discussion.

24:40.590 --> 24:41.440
Old Madam?

24:44.240 --> 24:45.030
Old Madam!

24:46.000 --> 24:46.920
Old Madam!

25:12.920 --> 25:15.110
I've endured everything without complaint

25:15.110 --> 25:16.270
for 20 years.

25:25.200 --> 25:27.070
All because I hoped you would find

25:28.270 --> 25:30.730
a husband
who truly loved and cherished you,

25:32.110 --> 25:34.160
so you could escape this misery.

25:35.310 --> 25:37.160
Not to be a gift for the Xie family

25:38.240 --> 25:40.550
to curry favor with the powerful.

25:47.000 --> 25:48.000
But...

25:50.640 --> 25:52.440
I have no way to stop this either.

25:59.350 --> 26:00.110
Third Madam.

26:01.310 --> 26:02.240
Eldest Sister.

26:08.030 --> 26:10.030
I have a plan to break this deadlock.

26:11.510 --> 26:13.570
I wonder if you'd be willing to try it.

26:22.550 --> 26:23.680
Old Madam!

26:25.270 --> 26:26.030
Old Madam!

26:26.160 --> 26:27.020
Eldest Lady...

26:27.110 --> 26:27.970
Eldest Lady...

26:28.030 --> 26:28.920
Calm down.

26:29.030 --> 26:30.310
What happened to Eldest Lady?

26:30.310 --> 26:31.830
Eldest Lady is missing!

26:33.200 --> 26:34.310
What?

26:36.140 --> 26:38.200
-Search thoroughly!
-Eldest Lady!

26:38.200 --> 26:39.730
Where're you, Eldest Lady?

26:41.080 --> 26:42.280
-Eldest Lady!
-Eldest Lady!

26:42.280 --> 26:44.440
-Eldest Lady!
-Eldest Lady!

26:44.790 --> 26:46.190
-Eldest Lady!
-Eldest Lady!

26:46.190 --> 26:46.890
Eldest Lady!

26:46.890 --> 26:48.800
-Eldest Lady!
-Eldest Lady!

26:49.160 --> 26:49.880
She's not here.

26:49.880 --> 26:51.240
-Eldest Lady!
-Eldest Lady!

26:51.240 --> 26:52.960
Search every corner!

26:52.960 --> 26:54.080
-Eldest Lady!
-Eldest Lady!

26:54.080 --> 26:55.680
-Eldest Lady!
-Eldest Lady!

26:56.310 --> 26:57.040
Eldest Lady!

26:57.060 --> 26:57.790
-Master.
-Eldest Lady!

26:57.790 --> 26:58.960
-We still haven't found her.
-Eldest Lady!

26:58.960 --> 27:00.110
-Master.
-Eldest Lady!

27:00.110 --> 27:02.290
-Someone saw her flee toward the South Gate.
-Eldest Lady!

27:02.290 --> 27:03.720
-Go after her.
-Where are you?

27:03.720 --> 27:05.030
Head for the South Gate!

27:05.030 --> 27:05.960
She's at the South Gate!

27:05.960 --> 27:06.550
After her!

27:06.550 --> 27:07.720
Let's go. To the South Gate.

27:07.720 --> 27:09.240
Eldest Lady, where are you?

27:09.240 --> 27:10.650
-Eldest Lady!
-Eldest Lady!

27:10.650 --> 27:12.250
-Eldest Lady!
-Eldest Lady!

27:13.680 --> 27:14.720
Eldest Lady!

27:15.780 --> 27:16.840
Eldest Lady, where are you?

27:16.840 --> 27:18.470
Eldest Lady, where are you?

27:19.110 --> 27:20.270
Eldest Lady!

27:20.400 --> 27:21.920
[Qiyun Alley]

27:26.270 --> 27:26.830
My Lord,

27:27.510 --> 27:28.270
you see, right now,

27:28.270 --> 27:30.270
we've been catching
those small-fry officials.

27:30.270 --> 27:32.330
When are we going after a bigger fish?

27:32.510 --> 27:33.480
Don't rush.

27:34.440 --> 27:36.640
Once the small fry in the river are gone,

27:36.880 --> 27:38.590
even the most patient big fish

27:38.830 --> 27:40.030
will bite the bait

27:40.510 --> 27:41.510
when its food runs out.

27:41.510 --> 27:43.750
Eldest Lady, stop right there!

27:44.750 --> 27:45.880
-Cheers.
-Stop!

27:47.560 --> 27:48.600
Catch her!

27:50.400 --> 27:51.380
Go take a look.

27:51.550 --> 27:52.810
Eldest Lady!

27:52.960 --> 27:55.650
You can't elope, Eldest Lady!

27:55.670 --> 27:57.520
Eldest Lady, stop!

27:58.200 --> 27:59.270
Eldest Lady!

27:59.550 --> 28:00.350
Don't run!

28:00.510 --> 28:02.070
Hurry up. Eldest Lady!

28:02.070 --> 28:02.920
-She's over there!
-Stop!

28:02.920 --> 28:04.480
-Stop!
-Don't run!

28:06.790 --> 28:07.390
What is it?

28:08.240 --> 28:09.100
Nothing major.

28:09.240 --> 28:11.310
-The Xie family seems to be looking for...
-Stop!

28:11.310 --> 28:12.880
-their Eldest Lady who ran away.
-Eldest Lady!

28:12.880 --> 28:13.750
Don't run!

28:14.000 --> 28:15.150
Eldest Lady Xie?

28:15.240 --> 28:17.440
-Why is she running away?
-Eldest Lady!

28:23.510 --> 28:24.640
Who cares.

28:24.830 --> 28:25.560
Let's drink.

28:26.590 --> 28:27.050
Come on.

28:29.000 --> 28:29.830
Stop!

28:30.310 --> 28:31.160
Catch her!

28:31.160 --> 28:31.680
Don't run!

28:31.680 --> 28:32.430
Stop!

28:32.470 --> 28:33.030
Hurry up!

28:33.440 --> 28:34.550
-Stop!
-Don't run!

28:34.550 --> 28:35.550
Catch her!

28:35.750 --> 28:36.720
Stop!

28:37.640 --> 28:38.160
Don't run!

28:38.160 --> 28:39.700
-Stop!
-Don't run!

28:39.750 --> 28:40.480
Stop!

28:43.790 --> 28:44.850
What are you doing?

28:46.770 --> 28:48.620
[Guan-guan Go the Ospreys]

28:51.400 --> 28:53.000
Putting on a show, all of you?

28:53.000 --> 28:53.920
Honored lords,

28:54.440 --> 28:55.390
this old servant

28:55.830 --> 28:57.750
is in pursuit of
the Xie family's Eldest Lady,

28:57.750 --> 28:59.240
who has eloped.

28:59.240 --> 29:00.720
I hope you

29:01.000 --> 29:02.460
can show us some leniency.

29:03.640 --> 29:05.240
What are you waiting for? Go!

29:09.550 --> 29:10.550
Commander,

29:11.000 --> 29:14.820
if I can't bring back
the eloping Eldest Lady tonight,

29:14.880 --> 29:17.010
I won't be able to report back!

29:17.200 --> 29:19.860
I hope you can
grant us a small favor, Commander.

29:20.880 --> 29:22.810
What if she's not your Eldest Lady?

29:33.200 --> 29:34.400
Fourth Lady?

29:34.400 --> 29:36.430
She's not Eldest Lady.

29:36.480 --> 29:37.480
Commander, please forgive us.

29:37.480 --> 29:38.940
I got the wrong young lady.

29:39.160 --> 29:40.160
Stop right there!

29:40.880 --> 29:41.550
You come and go

29:41.550 --> 29:42.640
as you please.

29:42.880 --> 29:44.830
Have you no regard for me at all?

29:47.680 --> 29:48.960
Fourth Lady,

29:49.270 --> 29:50.160
Commander,

29:50.440 --> 29:52.070
this old servant's eyes must've failed me!

29:52.070 --> 29:53.930
Please forgive me, Commander.

29:54.440 --> 29:56.100
Commander, please calm down.

29:56.160 --> 29:57.960
She's just a crude maidservant.

29:58.110 --> 29:59.830
I beg you to show her mercy.

30:01.480 --> 30:02.720
Thank you, Fourth Lady.

30:02.720 --> 30:04.050
Thank you, Fourth Lady.

30:04.640 --> 30:06.400
Then, according to the Xie family rules,

30:06.400 --> 30:07.720
slap yourself 30 times—

30:07.720 --> 30:08.580
what do you say?

30:14.550 --> 30:16.080
Hurry up and slap yourself.

30:19.720 --> 30:20.400
One.

30:20.790 --> 30:21.510
Two.

30:22.240 --> 30:22.960
Two.

30:23.590 --> 30:24.200
Two.

30:24.920 --> 30:25.820
Two.

30:27.160 --> 30:28.460
Two.

30:29.070 --> 30:30.110
Three.

30:30.880 --> 30:32.000
Three.

30:32.310 --> 30:33.750
Alright, stop it.

30:35.720 --> 30:37.120
Keep slapping yourself!

30:39.000 --> 30:39.790
Hurry up.

30:47.400 --> 30:49.410
Twenty-nine. Thirty.

30:50.480 --> 30:51.340
Get out of here.

30:53.200 --> 30:54.730
Don't forget your lantern.

30:57.350 --> 30:59.080
Take care. We won't see you out!

32:23.240 --> 32:24.000
Mother,

32:24.310 --> 32:25.550
this wedding robe

32:26.200 --> 32:27.480
is really beautiful.

32:27.640 --> 32:33.330
♪ Waiting for a dream to sink into
the depths of the night ♪

32:28.880 --> 32:30.680
Try it on and let me see.

32:33.390 --> 32:39.460
♪ Waiting for a rain to wash away
the heat burning in my eyes ♪

32:39.530 --> 32:45.200
♪ Waiting for a few flowers to bloom,
then quietly fall ♪

32:45.220 --> 32:51.330
♪ Only then do I understand right
from what's wrong and bitter ♪

32:51.360 --> 32:57.520
♪ Pear blossoms drift through the courtyard,
fluttering like snowflakes in a song ♪

32:57.580 --> 33:03.670
♪ Singing the silence of love and hate ♪

33:01.830 --> 33:02.400
Mother,

33:02.400 --> 33:03.240
am I pretty?

33:03.700 --> 33:10.090
♪  Which moment is hypothetical,
and which is a real choice? ♪

33:04.830 --> 33:06.000
Yes.

33:07.350 --> 33:08.790
My Qinghe

33:09.240 --> 33:10.550
is truly beautiful.

33:10.150 --> 33:16.070
♪ Who is drifting aimlessly in the wind? ♪

33:16.160 --> 33:22.290
♪ I wonder why joy is always
so scarce in this world ♪

33:17.400 --> 33:18.350
You've

33:18.790 --> 33:20.640
always liked sleeping
without enough covers.

33:20.640 --> 33:22.320
Once I'm no longer by your side,

33:22.320 --> 33:28.260
♪ I wonder,
is that tear a loss or a gain? ♪

33:22.960 --> 33:23.680
be sure

33:24.000 --> 33:26.110
to keep yourself well covered
with blankets at night.

33:26.110 --> 33:27.840
Especially when autumn comes,

33:28.000 --> 33:29.590
wear more layers.

33:28.310 --> 33:34.530
♪ Two souls trapped on the opposite banks
of life and death ♪

33:30.350 --> 33:31.950
Don't let yourself get cold.

33:34.550 --> 33:40.550
♪ May you and I overcome karma's bonds ♪

33:37.400 --> 33:39.160
Once you're out there on your own,

33:39.160 --> 33:40.820
it won't be like being at home.

33:41.350 --> 33:42.350
Don't be too picky

33:42.750 --> 33:43.950
about food and drink,

33:44.960 --> 33:47.020
but don't mistreat yourself either.

33:49.790 --> 33:52.920
You must hide the jewelry and valuables

33:53.200 --> 33:54.640
in different places.

33:55.510 --> 33:57.350
If someone steals or robs you,

33:57.830 --> 33:59.560
at least you'll have some left.

34:00.880 --> 34:02.880
If Lanshan ever treats you badly...

34:07.240 --> 34:07.960
Mother,

34:08.830 --> 34:14.659
♪ Waiting for a dream to sink into
the depths of the night ♪

34:09.030 --> 34:10.230
please rest assured.

34:10.440 --> 34:12.570
Whether Lanshan treats me well or not,

34:12.840 --> 34:14.500
I'll take good care of myself.

34:14.690 --> 34:20.590
♪ Waiting for a rain to wash away
the heat burning in my eyes ♪

34:20.830 --> 34:26.179
♪ Waiting for a few flowers to bloom,
then quietly fall ♪

34:21.320 --> 34:22.440
But what about you?

34:24.150 --> 34:25.679
Have you ever thought about

34:26.270 --> 34:32.770
♪ Only then do I understand right
from what's wrong and bitter ♪

34:26.280 --> 34:27.440
what will happen after I...

34:27.440 --> 34:28.360
Eldest Lady!

34:29.230 --> 34:30.190
Eldest Lady,

34:30.480 --> 34:31.440
it's time to go.

34:32.880 --> 34:38.600
♪ Pear blossoms drift through the courtyard,
fluttering like snowflakes in a song ♪

34:33.630 --> 34:34.280
Mother.

34:37.480 --> 34:38.960
I've already figured out where to go.

34:38.659 --> 34:44.760
♪ Singing the silence of love and hate ♪

34:39.230 --> 34:39.800
Go.

34:39.960 --> 34:40.480
Mother.

34:40.960 --> 34:41.590
Let's go.

34:41.800 --> 34:42.960
-Or it'll be too late.
-Go.

34:42.960 --> 34:43.510
Mother.

34:43.880 --> 34:44.440
Go.

34:44.670 --> 34:45.320
Mother!

34:44.790 --> 34:51.179
♪  Which moment is hypothetical,
and which is a real choice? ♪

34:51.239 --> 34:57.550
♪ Who is drifting aimlessly in the wind? ♪

34:57.580 --> 35:03.940
♪ I wonder why joy is always
so scarce in this world ♪

35:04.050 --> 35:09.980
♪ I wonder,
is that tear a loss or a gain? ♪

35:10.030 --> 35:16.260
♪ Two souls trapped on the opposite banks
of life and death ♪

35:10.440 --> 35:12.030
Today, through tears,

35:12.030 --> 35:13.630
I see you off by the riverbank.

35:13.630 --> 35:15.000
The east wind blows for a thousand miles,

35:15.000 --> 35:16.200
like a distant dream.

35:16.270 --> 35:22.270
♪ May you and I overcome karma's bonds ♪

35:17.000 --> 35:19.530
Eldest Sister has finally
escaped this cage,

35:19.670 --> 35:21.030
with a whole world before her.

35:21.030 --> 35:22.360
Now she can live for herself.

35:22.360 --> 35:28.160
♪ The wind blows away old memories,
piling them in heaps before the door ♪

35:22.480 --> 35:23.610
So envious, are you?

35:24.070 --> 35:25.930
If you could let go of your hatred,

35:26.550 --> 35:28.010
you could also leave here.

35:28.160 --> 35:34.180
♪ No one speaks for anyone else ♪

35:28.190 --> 35:29.230
Why envy others?

35:30.230 --> 35:31.280
What about you?

35:32.230 --> 35:33.800
Commander, would you be willing to

35:33.800 --> 35:34.960
return to Anxiang Village with me,

35:34.290 --> 35:40.580
♪ Which page is a missed opportunity,
and which holds my hopes? ♪

35:35.230 --> 35:37.000
to never concern yourself
with worldly affairs again,

35:37.000 --> 35:38.600
and to set aside all grudges?

35:40.610 --> 35:47.060
♪ Forgotten in a lonely corner ♪

35:47.080 --> 35:53.110
♪ Waiting for time
to teach us both how to let go ♪

35:49.150 --> 35:50.110
I can't.

35:51.070 --> 35:52.870
What about you, Fourth Lady Xie?

35:53.140 --> 35:59.500
♪ Waiting for our wounds to heal,
no longer asking why ♪

35:57.480 --> 35:59.080
You already know the answer.

35:59.520 --> 36:05.600
♪ Waiting for us to slowly learn
the shapes of love and hate in this life ♪

35:59.550 --> 36:00.960
People like us,

36:01.670 --> 36:03.320
with hearts full of hatred

36:03.710 --> 36:04.480
and schemes,

36:05.000 --> 36:06.550
can never find peace.

36:05.620 --> 36:11.990
♪ Waiting for one final goodbye,
then letting go ♪

36:14.030 --> 36:15.030
Regardless,

36:15.210 --> 36:23.760
♪ No more wandering and worrying ♪

36:15.360 --> 36:16.550
thank you,

36:16.710 --> 36:18.590
Lord Shen, for helping me out tonight.

36:18.590 --> 36:19.920
You don't owe me anything.

36:19.920 --> 36:20.980
No need to thank me.

36:21.550 --> 36:24.150
I'm thanking you
on behalf of my eldest sister.

36:25.070 --> 36:26.280
May she

36:26.550 --> 36:27.840
be safe and well,

36:28.320 --> 36:29.850
free of hatred and grudges.

36:41.480 --> 36:43.680
A mere servant of yours went out to catch

36:43.760 --> 36:46.550
your daughter in an illicit affair,
and actually dragged me into it.

36:46.550 --> 36:48.800
My Lord, you truly
ought to think carefully

36:48.800 --> 36:50.730
about what explanation you owe me.

36:51.800 --> 36:53.360
In a single night,

36:54.960 --> 36:57.000
my most obedient eldest daughter

36:57.000 --> 36:58.320
eloped with a man.

36:58.550 --> 37:00.750
And my most beloved youngest daughter,

37:01.510 --> 37:02.840
who is already engaged,

37:03.030 --> 37:06.030
was caught meeting another man
in secret late at night

37:06.110 --> 37:07.800
and disturbed the Commander.

37:08.480 --> 37:09.320
Great.

37:10.760 --> 37:12.800
Just great, all of you.

37:13.800 --> 37:15.880
This was entirely my doing.

37:16.480 --> 37:18.030
It has nothing to do with Qingyuan.

37:18.030 --> 37:20.160
She couldn't bear to see her own sister

37:20.670 --> 37:22.930
forced to marry an old man as a concubine.

37:23.630 --> 37:25.000
What did she do wrong?

37:29.710 --> 37:30.840
Concubine Lian,

37:31.800 --> 37:34.730
I always thought
you were gentle and well-mannered.

37:34.880 --> 37:36.190
And I believed

37:36.510 --> 37:38.510
I'd treated your branch fairly.

37:39.550 --> 37:41.480
Do you realize that because of you,

37:41.800 --> 37:43.600
the reputation of the Xie family

37:43.880 --> 37:45.670
has been ruined

37:46.360 --> 37:47.590
overnight?

37:53.030 --> 37:54.830
Do you realize your wrongdoing?

37:55.030 --> 37:57.320
The reputation and face

37:57.920 --> 37:59.230
of the Xie family again.

37:59.230 --> 38:01.880
You haven't grown tired of

38:02.800 --> 38:05.730
saying these high-sounding things
all these years,

38:06.000 --> 38:07.600
but I'm sick of hearing them.

38:10.000 --> 38:11.070
Xie Shu!

38:12.030 --> 38:13.480
You keep claiming

38:14.110 --> 38:16.570
that everything you do
is for the Xie family.

38:16.760 --> 38:17.820
Then let me ask you—

38:19.190 --> 38:20.630
you used your son's death

38:21.070 --> 38:22.690
to claim credit and gain a title,

38:22.690 --> 38:23.960
and then you forced your daughter

38:23.960 --> 38:25.480
to marry a 60-year-old man

38:26.070 --> 38:29.670
from the Hu family—the very family
responsible for your son's death!

38:29.670 --> 38:30.880
In your heart,

38:31.440 --> 38:33.150
does this so-called Xie family

38:33.150 --> 38:34.030
include them?

38:34.190 --> 38:35.250
Does it include me?

38:35.320 --> 38:36.850
Or is it only ever about you?

38:47.110 --> 38:47.710
Servants,

38:48.800 --> 38:50.590
punish her according to the family rules.

38:50.590 --> 38:51.850
Right here in the hall.

38:52.320 --> 38:53.780
Fifty strokes of the cane!

38:54.030 --> 38:54.760
Yes, Master.

38:56.960 --> 38:57.960
No, Father.

38:58.400 --> 39:00.360
You'd better keep out of this!

39:01.030 --> 39:01.670
Father,

39:02.230 --> 39:04.360
my own mother and Fifth Madam are dead.

39:04.480 --> 39:06.680
Mother is confined in Wuzhu Courtyard.

39:07.670 --> 39:10.320
Second Madam's gone mad
and has been sent to a suburban estate.

39:10.320 --> 39:12.360
If something happens to
Third Madam as well,

39:12.360 --> 39:13.110
I'm afraid

39:13.590 --> 39:15.030
the disgrace brought upon
the Xie family will be far greater

39:15.030 --> 39:16.760
than the things
Eldest Sister and I have done.

39:16.760 --> 39:19.260
I know you are furious right now, Father,

39:19.360 --> 39:21.150
but this matter carries too much weight.

39:21.150 --> 39:22.880
I feel I must advise against it.

39:29.760 --> 39:32.030
What fine twisted logic.

39:32.510 --> 39:33.960
By your reasoning,

39:34.440 --> 39:36.920
after all this commotion,

39:37.190 --> 39:39.550
we can't even punish

39:40.110 --> 39:41.550
Lian Fanqiao?

39:45.400 --> 39:47.400
Father, Grandmother, you blame me,

39:47.400 --> 39:49.000
and I have nothing to say to that.

39:49.000 --> 39:50.800
I am willing to accept punishment.

39:50.800 --> 39:51.480
Qingyuan,

39:52.550 --> 39:53.550
no need to beg him.

39:56.840 --> 39:58.110
In over 20 years...

40:00.920 --> 40:02.380
I've never felt more alive

40:03.150 --> 40:04.710
than I do right now.

40:06.880 --> 40:08.280
All these years,

40:09.360 --> 40:11.760
I never dared ask for
fine silks or jewelry,

40:13.360 --> 40:15.230
nor ask for love or affection.

40:15.920 --> 40:19.710
Even when my best friend was wronged,

40:20.510 --> 40:22.360
I could only stand by and watch,

40:24.190 --> 40:26.650
not daring to
utter a single word of protest.

40:27.000 --> 40:28.230
Because I know

40:29.590 --> 40:31.150
that in this household,

40:32.320 --> 40:34.280
there isn't a single living soul

40:35.070 --> 40:35.960
who doesn't

40:36.310 --> 40:38.710
swallow their own suffering in silence!

40:38.880 --> 40:39.630
Shut up!

40:39.630 --> 40:40.800
I'm not finished!

40:45.190 --> 40:46.880
You can bully me,

40:47.510 --> 40:50.150
but you cannot bully my daughter.

40:51.070 --> 40:53.360
All these years I've swallowed my pride
and endured everything

40:53.360 --> 40:55.190
just to keep her safe.

40:55.630 --> 40:57.030
She's not an object.

40:57.630 --> 40:58.960
And she certainly isn't

40:59.030 --> 41:01.150
a stepping stone
for you to climb the social ladder!

41:01.150 --> 41:02.110
Impertinent!

41:09.880 --> 41:10.880
Today,

41:12.800 --> 41:14.530
I've finally set my Qinghe free

41:15.510 --> 41:18.150
from this den of horrors
that devours people.

41:20.710 --> 41:22.190
I, Lian Fanqiao...

41:25.960 --> 41:27.670
have no regrets in this life.

41:34.030 --> 41:35.480
Kill me, torture me,

41:36.070 --> 41:37.470
or throw me into the pond—

41:39.960 --> 41:41.440
do as you please.

41:48.190 --> 41:49.280
I've had enough

41:51.110 --> 41:53.150
of this cage for far too long!
